  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a terracotta dish over medium heat.",
    "Add the ginger paste and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts and sukju, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cumin powder, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the Tunisian preserved lemon, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the mixture is fluffy and tangy.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired.",
    "Let the tagine rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Note: this recipe is for refrigerator pickling/preserving only — store in the refrigerator and consume within 1 week. Do not water-bath can without an acid (vinegar or lemon juice)."
